<title>UK: SEK sets 20 bln yen two-year dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>SEK sets 20 bln yen two-year dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH EXPORT CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.30	MATURITY    27.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  100	 PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IS U.S. DOLLARS</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	 MOODY/S&amp;P    AA3/AA+</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION AT $4,390.59 PER 500,000 YEN</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		LIMITED FOREX PROTECTION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
